{"id":"wb-8-274","name":"杭州忠义桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"忠义桥","text":"忠义桥位于中华人民共和国浙江省杭州市西湖区留下街道，东西横跨西溪河，建于南宋嘉定戊寅年（1218年），是杭州市区唯一的宋代桥梁原物，也是杭州现存最古老的石拱桥。相传为孙侯为了纪念兄弟情谊而修造。\n桥长15.2米，宽3.65米，拱跨8米，矢高3.2米。桥面铺设长青石，东西有十多级台阶。\n2005年3月，上升为浙江省文物保护单位。2019年被列入第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BF%A0%E4%B9%89%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":86356911,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86356911","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7df8e9b304f14696bd9c948c.jpg","title":"Zhongyi_Bridge,_Hangzhou,_2019-11-09_08.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zhongyi_Bridge,_Hangzhou,_2019-11-09_08.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/Zhongyi_Bridge%2C_Hangzhou%2C_2019-11-09_08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​杭州留下忠义桥","width":320,"height":213}}